{"id":"na_chster","lemma":"nächster","pos":"adj","rank":2101,"glosses":["next, following"],"ipa":"/ˈnɛːstɐ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/8b/De-n%C3%A4chster.ogg/De-n%C3%A4chster.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Wer ist als nächster an der Reihe?","en":"Who is next?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/34574","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"at the same moment"},null,{"g":"at / on"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"row"}]},{"text":"Die Frage lautet: Wer wird unser nächster Präsident?","en":"The question is who'll be our next president.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"question"},{"g":"to be, to read","l":"lauten"},{"g":"who"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"our"},null,{"g":"president"}]},{"text":"Tom kommt als Nächster dran.","en":"Tom is the next in line.","words":[null,{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"},{"g":"at the same moment"},null,{"g":"to be in a particular…"}]},{"text":"Was glaubst du, wer als nächster durch die Tür kommt?","en":"Who do you think will be the next person to walk through that door?","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"to believe something","l":"glauben"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"who"},{"g":"at the same moment"},null,{"g":"by means of"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"door"},{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"}]},{"text":"Du hast gesagt, daß du mir als nächster helfen würdest.","en":"You said you'd help me next.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"to say (to pronounce","l":"sagen"},null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"at the same moment"},null,{"g":"to help"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"}]}]}